    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>所有人都在夸梁文锋格局高，创始人看到的却是一张算得极精的账：硬件10个月回本、API按成本6倍定价，融资的钱继续买卡。“反正开了你也做不了”，这句话才是把同行吓惨了的成本壁垒；从绕开英伟达生态，到Agent自我迭代，这场闭门讲话泄露的，是理想主义背后的商业门道。</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> “梁圣”的克制，是格局还是一套精密算法？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="318">05:18</a> 10个月回本、6倍定价，这笔账到底怎么算？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="568">09:28</a> 融资全部买卡，贵四倍也买：不比放银行香吗？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="667">11:07</a> 谁有资格上车？DeepSeek把融资也做成了定价权</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="889">14:49</a> 开源只是试吃，真正的护城河藏在哪里？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1207">20:07</a> TileLang重构底层算子，国产芯片真能绕开英伟达？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1291">21:31</a> Claude加一两个工程师，竟然做完AMD硬件适配原型</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1485">24:45</a> 模型越来越少谈，为什么真正卡住的是上下文与工程化？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1647">27:27</a> 具身智能为什么要等？现实世界才是最后几十公里</span></p><p><span>【 JustSayAI 早晚报飞书版上新】</span><br><span>🔥订阅「</span><a href="https://justsayai.org/" data-url="https://justsayai.org/"><u><span>JustSayAI 早晚报</span></u></a><span>」· 每日两封 · 一键听报</span></p><p><span>【关注频道】</span><br><span>▶️</span><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@justsayaiorg" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/@justsayaiorg"><u><span>Youtube</span></u></a><span>｜ 📺</span><a href="https://space.bilibili.com/491787323" data-url="https://space.bilibili.com/491787323"><u><span>B 站</span></u></a><span>｜ 📕</span><a href="https://xhslink.com/m/zk4VuViFL4" data-url="https://xhslink.com/m/zk4VuViFL4"><u><span>小红书</span></u></a><span>｜ 🎵</span><a href="https://v.douyin.com/YizxNAvO414/" data-url="https://v.douyin.com/YizxNAvO414/"><u><span>抖音</span></u></a><span>｜ 📻</span><a href="https://justsayaiorg.podcast.xyz/" data-url="https://justsayaiorg.podcast.xyz/"><u><span>Podcast</span></u></a><br><span>📱 商务合作/听友群：justsayai666</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fsnw_kSbcPOoyBXkW3